            { label: 'Use the average of 5% and 20% (12.5%) as a compromise', consequence: 'Mechanical averaging ignores the analysis. Why would the true growth rate be exactly halfway between industry average and management guidance? Scenario analysis with justification for each case is far more rigorous than splitting the difference.', score: 1 }
