            { label: 'Run the model through a spell-checker', consequence: 'A spell-checker catches typos in labels, not errors in formulas. Financial model errors are mathematical and logical, wrong cell references, hard-coded numbers, broken links, incorrect formulas. These require systematic auditing, not surface-level checks.', score: 0 }
