          explanation: 'Try distinguishing a 22% slice from a 25% slice in a pie chart, it\'s nearly impossible. A bar chart makes this difference obvious. Treemaps add another dimension: the S&P 500 treemap on finviz.com shows sector weights, individual stock weights, and daily performance all in one view.'
