      'Financial Analytics Capstone',
      'Goldman Sachs had 600 equity traders in 2000. By 2017, it had just 2, replaced by 200 engineers running automated trading algorithms. Financial analytics isn\'t just a skill; it\'s the future of finance.',
      'In this capstone, you\'ll integrate everything, statistics, regression, Monte Carlo simulation, data visualization, and machine learning, into a complete financial analysis workflow, just like real analysts at Morgan Stanley, Goldman Sachs, and Renaissance Technologies.',
